```{=html}
<div class="post-list">
<% for (const item of items) { %>
<div class="post-row" <%= metadataAttrs(item) %>>
<a class="post-title" href="<%- item.path.replace(/index\.(qmd|html)$/, '') %>"><%= item.title %></a>
<div class="post-meta"><span class="post-date"><%= item.date %></span><% if (item.description) { %> &bull; <%= item.description %><% } %></div>
</div>
<% } %>
</div>
```
